      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;The war is over. Horde Primeâ€™s death has ushered in an era of unprecedented peace in Etheria, with She-Ra and the Alliance at its helm. And against all odds, Adora has feelings for Catra - loves her, even. Catraâ€™s never had more to be grateful for in her life.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Somehow, itâ€™s still not enough.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
